<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces have quietly relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy while the Defence Minister announced the killing of nearly 285 al-Shabaab fighters, including 12 leaders, in Bay, Shabelle and Hiiraan. The United States carried out airstrikes against al-Shabaab at three sites in Somalia and President Museveni of Uganda met Somalia's President to discuss regional security and the AU peacekeeping transition, with the Ugandan army chief visiting Somali troops amid a withdrawal from Barawe. Somalia warned that unrest in Ethiopia could weaken security operations involving the African Union mission, and the conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/yemen/core-yemen-situation-displacement-overview-23-nov-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOY0dyaTRNZXgtS2lrc0l0c001WEpYdXp5OUowWEx3QU9ZRXViZVh1UGZQaERtOTRuZGZ0TzJZeTZoUmtxOE00TERiR0VQUlRQamFJYVZ1dU5UWFlSNzZfMGVTTlQxWXRFMXk2MXplZVFTUmhqS0lzVlRhRkVDQ2t2cXZzak5SYmhfNW91YXVTd0ZKaGlNRS05NlNsU2gxWmNENEg4R2psaGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSnVXZTRHeHhvcHhsZGVHNENMZWphYWdZZGxfdmE1NUVKRlB6YUdQT0tlZnZqX0hlYWx6cmdyeHl0NmktNXc5Q2d0RlNzTEhhMjZWUmxnX1NTNm1kNjBscEFkaEdCYWM2UFd0cWRtWXZLaTZheWVMTTlUblRGeWlacnM3NWkxeXdEUkRraVZnbWs3M3FzLTdSMnd4UC1yNUtaLWh3allFMVVEb2ZIR0RxYWxSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5vdjZUR2NpZnRyQnBLX0k3RDZfM0NLUEFRcFY3cmxBaDRXVzNMTnBSU2R2b1ZEUnBNREhwd3BaVnFLZm9oTTBBUE5vN2FVNkRETjdMUGxMTkVFcGh6cVNzT2JSeUEtSDNfQWpkOG1sZTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;S